{"id":2225,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>抢抓春季招聘黄金期，全力促进毕业生顺利就业。2026年4月16日，中北大学2026年航空宇航学院春季招聘会在东区训练馆顺利举办。本次招聘会由航空宇航学院联合机电工程、机械工程、信息与通信工程、电气与控制工程等学院组织举办，旨在整合校内外资源，搭建精准对接平台，助力2026届毕业生更高质量、更充分就业。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MR9WbL8UbL4G8LHRlanmvPL4QkMzGg8LlliM7CPL4GPU4C0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhVokyDn1hVMRVRozV7Ml-8MRvDLRUsUlWVM7U8U4CZL8MFUl74ozf7L4VFL46fMz9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7E86FE41C91D5B4476047ABE4D4C683C/AA390D31/37A58\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MR9WbL8UbL4G8LHRlanmvPL4QkMzGg8LlliM7CPL4GPU4C0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhVokyDn1hVMRVRozV7Ml-8MRvDLRUsUlWVM7U8U4CZL8MFUl74ozf7L4VFL46fMz9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次招聘会吸引了来自全国各地的百余家优质企业，涵盖能源、机械、电气、信息技术、航空航天等多个行业领域，需求覆盖本科、硕士及博士全学历层次，为毕业生带来大量适配度高、发展前景广阔的优质岗位。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-U8CWPL4M7LRvDMHNlDolL4LmMkn7lgZLlliMRrkL8MfUml0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDnky8MShkMzN8Umn7nRCDMRUin7C4LmAVolQ2oz9snzQFnzfVL7MkM7QFoz6fL8-Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B6D45B594B4DD66445DF328E9FF987E6/E0E0CB4F/97A3B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-L4rW7UlUioRUsMHNLsL49aM4LDoRGgaLR6VUzn7MRC8L4C0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy8M1yZn1y4UlQVnm6RLmfRLNLbn7LPnRWfL8M7L8rRM8WFUz74M4GPnR6FLlW7LzLYgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSybM4GsgtA8pULcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-olMWfMRrVnRvYLHllsnl-YU4U4L8LgbM7M2nRUaMR6RM4G0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybLYyiMShkn7rRMmQVLzCsUNVfo7C8nmvsU4f7UNLinzWFUNUYM8UDU4fFUmGZo7CJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D9355BDEC66E167BAA8F4F77C0DBC5E2/BD27D6C0/B088F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-M4AW7M8UiozM2MHzCiM7UDL8L4MzQg7oRTfMmQfU8CiLmC0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nSyPMSh2nRlaLRCaMlrkolQ2LmV2Lmf2MRAfn7-DMlWFU4MfMRrRU8QFLmLZL8lbgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSybM4GsgtA8pULcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-M7LWiMR7bMz-iLH8V2MlU4MNC8nm6g2L7VVLmCaoz78nlC0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hVMkhRoSyZUmrko7L4nzl4ozUbUzGZMmLPnl-4oRVVUzrFMRCDM7r7MzVFU474olLJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6E4C98B5B8C3E53949A08631EB381EA5/4664ED51/C139C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-o7nWkM4G4U8UaMH4-iM4vsUz7YM8UgsLm78n7WkL46VnzC0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfUYh7nSybUmr7nRA2nmMfL7lPUml8nNCDUllZMz6fnmfFLlLDo7CDU8MFLmV7Mm7igjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSybM4GsgtA8pULcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>学院高度重视此次招聘会，积极参与组织工作。学院党委副书记张丽花、学生科科长段志薇前往招聘会现场，深入了解企业用人需求，并与应聘毕业生亲切交流，询问求职进展及签约情况；同时与参会企业代表进行沟通，探讨校企深度合作。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nl7WYL4vPUmU8UHmT7LzGPnmC4M4LgbozLaolM2LzMfM8-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyYLYyPLSysU8WVnmf7MRGsL87so7WfUzN8U8UaMzvDUznFUm9iUl7iMzMFL49anzLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E23117CBEF0D4073A78BAA94CD0576A4/B85AA553/380E3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nl7WYL4vPUmU8UHmT7LzGPnmC4M4LgbozLaolM2LzMfM8-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyYLYyPLSysU8WVnmf7MRGsL87so7WfUzN8U8UaMzvDUznFUm9iUl7iMzMFL49anzLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nmvWaU8-inlWfnHRA2M4LioRNbn7ngVozUsnNUanz-bM4G0gihFp2hmCIa0MShRLky4nSyDUmAfo7W2M8UYnRWVUmnfn7rRMmLiM8MRU8QFnNV2LmV2LRrFL4n7MNLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5C03E6B8A8BF7D2D2EB4ADEC6357CCCF/FAF21F05/34D6C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nmvWaU8-inlWfnHRA2M4LioRNbn7ngVozUsnNUanz-bM4G0gihFp2hmCIa0MShRLky4nSyDUmAfo7W2M8UYnRWVUmnfn7rRMmLiM8MRU8QFnNV2LmV2LRrFL4n7MNLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-U8-W8nN-anlQfnHRVRMlrknznVnm7gPLRV2MzA2LRfVLNU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysoSysMkyZn7QRM4v4LRGiUzWVM474LRARnRGYnl-8nRTFL8LYnR7YL7MFMz6VnzNJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C79748DFC773005A2E71308CD02EB4D9/3C2D120C/57EE9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-U8-W8nN-anlQfnHRVRMlrknznVnm7gPLRV2MzA2LRfVLNU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysoSysMkyZn7QRM4v4LRGiUzWVM474LRARnRGYnl-8nRTFL8LYnR7YL7MFMz6VnzNJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MlLWDnRMRozVRMH4vYU4CYLzAfLNrg2nNM2nRUPLm9PLm90gihFp2hmCIa0nkysUShfMkybUm9ZLzGinzr2M77sozU4ozTfU4NPnN-ZoRMFMRC8Lz6kM8VFMRGio77Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D7AA49B88105E5F4A794399AC91FB883/46417B7A/4058A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MlLWDnRMRozVRMH4vYU4CYLzAfLNrg2nNM2nRUPLm9PLm90gihFp2hmCIa0nkysUShfMkybUm9ZLzGinzr2M77sozU4ozTfU4NPnN-ZoRMFMRC8Lz6kM8VFMRGio77Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>与航空宇航学院专业高度相关的多家航空航天类企业，以及机械、电气、自动化等领域的众多优质单位齐聚一堂。现场气氛火热，各参展单位通过展位宣讲、宣传册发放、互动问答等方式，呈现公司特色、岗位需求、薪资待遇及成长路径。部分企业开辟了快速面试通道，从简历收取到现场面试衔接紧密，流程高效便捷，极大满足了本科及硕士各专业毕业生的求职需求。前来应聘的学生们主动向招聘方了解岗位详情，充分展示自身专业功底与技能，现场多人达成初步录用意向。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-o7VWRo7CZU8rVLH4rkL7UaL7QfoR6gRnzGaMRfRozv4MR90gihFp2hmCIa0oShRn1yboSyZMRL8nl-bnR-bLR9Znl7aM4UYnNMRoRTkLm6FnRTVnlVRLznFUN-inzCJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9CF998434EB9D29088EA0742FCC89B27/D9EEAC14/BB5E6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MmNWaU4VfnzG4MHzLsLmL8LRNZnN-gDMRliozTVLNn2nzl0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDL1y8MSyanmfRnznRMR94n77ZoR-ZLRlYM8UPLRf7UzTFolUaMz-sM4TFLmUDM8-sgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSybM4GsgtA8pULcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.png\"></p><p>此次五学院联合春季招聘会为航空宇航学院毕业生搭建了高质量的就业平台，也进一步密切了学院与企业的联系。航空宇航学院将以本次招聘会为契机，持续开展访企拓岗专项行动，拓展优质企业资源，加强分类指导和就业帮扶，全力促进2026届毕业生更加充分、更高质量就业。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MR9WbL8UbL4G8LHRlanmvPL4QkMzGg8LlliM7CPL4GPU4C0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhVokyDn1hVMRVRozV7Ml-8MRvDLRUsUlWVM7U8U4CZL8MFUl74ozf7L4VFL46fMz9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLRvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9707&e=.jpg"}